    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>TinyIsland</strong>, a treasure trove of incredible resources is hidden! But watch out\u2014every night, hordes of terrifying monsters swarm the island, all trying to claim it. As the rightful owner, it\u2019s your job to protect the island at all costs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and build structures to collect gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save up your gold wisely to buy building cards and hero cards when you need them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, enemies swarm the island! During the day, you must build and upgrade your hero\u2019s skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the waves and take down as many enemies as possible to rack up more gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 waves, a boss appears. Defeat it to choose the cards you want and grow stronger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to the island\u2019s changing terrain with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building and hero cards disappear after one use, so make every choice count!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>TinyIsland</strong>, a treasure trove of incredible resources is hidden! But watch out\u2014every night, hordes of terrifying monsters swarm the island, all trying to claim it. As the rightful owner, it\u2019s your job to protect the island at all costs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and build structures to collect gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save up your gold wisely to buy building cards and hero cards when you need them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, enemies swarm the island! During the day, you must build and upgrade your hero\u2019s skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the waves and take down as many enemies as possible to rack up more gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 waves, a boss appears. Defeat it to choose the cards you want and grow stronger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to the island\u2019s changing terrain with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building and hero cards disappear after one use, so make every choice count!</p></li></ul>",
